Music and alarm additions
The Focus timer has gentle chime/bell-style alarm options and can use an audio file selected from your device for the current session. Select the file again after reopening FocusMate. Browser permissions and Android power settings can affect playback.
Break Music provides direct links to Spotify, YouTube and Boomplay. It can embed eligible YouTube video links and Spotify track/album/playlist links where those services allow it. Boomplay is opened externally in this starter. Some music needs sign-in/premium and may not play in embedded mode.
The music feature does not download, copy, or bypass restrictions on copyrighted music. Keep the app open during breaks; Android may pause background audio.